{title: Aaj Kal Tere Mere Pyar Ke Charche}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Aaj kal tere mere pyar ke charche har,        [D]zaban par
Sab ko [E]Malum hai aur sabko khabar,        [A]ho gayi
[A]Humne to pyar me aisa,        [D]kaam kar [A]liya
Pyar [E]Ki Raah me apna,        [D]Naam kar [A]Liya
Pya [D]Ki raah [A]Me Apna naam kar liya,        [A]DO Badan ek dil ek [D]Jaan Ho [A]gaye
[E]Manzilen Ek hui hum [D]safar Ban [A]gaye,        [D]Manzile ek [A]Hui hamsafar ban gaye
[A]Kyo bhala hum dare dil ke [D]Malik hai hum
[E]Har janam me tuze apna [D]mana [A]sanam,        [D]Har janam me [A]Tujhe apna maana sanam
